  "item_short_desc": "<p>Navigate the outdoors in style and comfort with our Diamond Quilted Cotton Jacket. This midweight jacket is a great outer layer for spring and fall activities like hiking on a trail, sitting around the campfire, and cleaning up the yard, along with casually wearing around town or during a weekend trip. Without a doubt, this quilted will become part of your go-to outdoor wardrobe!</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133336",
  "description": "<p>Navigate the great outdoors in style and comfort with our Diamond Quilted Cotton Jacket. This midweight jacket is a great outer layer for spring and fall activities like hiking on a trail, sitting around the campfire, and cleaning up the yard, along with casually wearing around town or during a weekend trip. Without a doubt, this quilted will become part of your go-to outdoor wardrobe! Warm &amp; Comfortable: With stylish diamond quilting, a cotton twill outer shell, a cotton flannel body liner, polyester taffeta sleeve liners, and polyester filling, our insulated jackets provide all-day comfort and warmth, no matter the location. Protection from the Elements: These outdoor jackets feature a full-length front zipper with a 7-snap storm placket flap that helps keep the wind and rain out. The adjustable 2 snap-button wrist cuffs provide additional protection and allow you to roll up the sleeves when needed. Utility Pockets: With practicality in mind, our jackets contain a variety of pockets: 2 snap chest pockets for carrying your wallet, keys, and other small essentials; 2 front zipper slash pockets for keeping your hands warm; and 1 inner pocket on the right with a hook &amp; loop closure to secure your cellphone and other everyday carry items. Extended Coverage: These rugged quilt jackets are designed with a drop tail back that keeps you covered and protected without sacrificing your range of motion. Go ahead and rake those leaves in comfort!</p>",
